<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $1.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $1.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50 lower. Trade moderate. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     57.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     56.50-57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     54.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     51.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to 0.50 lower on all weights. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     45.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs     49.50</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs     50.00</p>
</text>
